/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (The ShED Forum \(Shershahbadi Educational Dialogue Forum\) is a community-led educational initiative established in 2018 that advances educational awareness and promotes higher education among the Shershahbadi community, which faces significant educational and socio-economic challenges and remains underrepresented in higher education institutions. The forum believes that education is the most powerful instrument for overcoming marginalization, expanding opportunities, and enabling sustainable social progress.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
115 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (By fostering dialogue, mentorship, guidance, and educational awareness, the Forum seeks to inspire students to pursue higher education and realize their academic aspirations. We believe that empowering individuals through education is the most effective pathway to strengthening the community as a whole and ensuring its meaningful participation in the broader social, intellectual, and economic life of the nation.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
