/P 101 0 R
/E (The Forum conducts ground campaigns to identify students at the grassroots level and connect them with educational opportunities. Through our Career Counseling and Admission Help Desk initiatives, students receive assistance in choosing academic pathways, understanding admission procedures, and navigating opportunities in universities and colleges across the country. Our mentorship programs provide continuous support to students through experienced mentors who guide them in their academic and professional journeys. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
