150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (Today, The Forum continues its founding vision of reducing the distance between the community and universities. What began as a small initiative has grown into an educational movement involving students, alumni, mentors, and community members committed to education, empowerment, opportunity, and social progress.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
